{"diagram":{"image":{"x":0,"width":200,"y":0,"pngdata":"","height":200},"elements":{"leftChildren":[],"comments":[],"children":[{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"cffdce92f4b4c48d","children":[],"id":"a32a032690de1183","title":"就是一个简化的编程模型。&nbsp;比如，我们在操作文件的时候，我们只用关心，打开流<br>然后使用这个流读数据。&nbsp;不断的读，读到的就是下一个数据。&nbsp;<br>等到流中的数据读完之后，我们的所有数据也读完了<br>"},{"parent":"cffdce92f4b4c48d","children":[{"parent":"1bb9f4600fde065f","children":[],"id":"e8d4622a3613b8dc","title":"操作一个流的标准步骤"},{"parent":"1bb9f4600fde065f","children":[],"id":"5bc3709e8249bec5","title":"1.打开流"},{"parent":"1bb9f4600fde065f","children":[],"id":"383ae0da8d582108","title":"2.判断。&nbsp;判断是否为NULL"},{"parent":"1bb9f4600fde065f","children":[],"id":"3379c0c370390f51","title":"3.使用"},{"parent":"1bb9f4600fde065f","children":[],"id":"2dad66ee01366dd4","title":"4.关闭流"}],"id":"1bb9f4600fde065f","title":"目录流：&nbsp;就是用来读取目录信息的。首先打开流，读取流。&nbsp;"}],"id":"cffdce92f4b4c48d","title":"流"},{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"50c6233b92d429a4","children":[],"id":"a300dd310741cf30","title":"系统调用是什么"},{"parent":"50c6233b92d429a4","children":[{"parent":"30b0e57a43c6d4a1","children":[],"id":"58ad255630cc9267","title":"ISO-C"},{"parent":"30b0e57a43c6d4a1","children":[],"id":"35ee24ea0edf9cb8","title":"POSIX-C"},{"parent":"30b0e57a43c6d4a1","children":[],"id":"0b6af23275d675b9","title":"这两个名词的含义，&nbsp;以及它们谁更通用。&nbsp;"}],"id":"30b0e57a43c6d4a1","title":"库函数得知道"},{"parent":"50c6233b92d429a4","children":[],"id":"d0e807617f116b26","title":"shell得知道一下"},{"parent":"50c6233b92d429a4","children":[],"id":"c460708aceca45c0","title":"知道这几者的关系，然后怎么选也要知道一下"},{"parent":"50c6233b92d429a4","children":[{"parent":"b4d88bdbeca7f476","children":[],"id":"6612fe81d46e5dcb","title":"会先学习文件系统编程，&nbsp;后续是进程和线程，最后是网络"},{"parent":"b4d88bdbeca7f476","children":[],"id":"cae008a08c2089a2","title":"因为Linux里面，一切皆文件。学会了文件操作，后续的很多操作都是通的。"}],"id":"b4d88bdbeca7f476","title":"学习顺序"},{"parent":"50c6233b92d429a4","children":[{"parent":"8466847fbb5b519d","children":[],"id":"365fdd343cca67e0","title":"因为系统编程这块，会学习大量的函数。&nbsp;强行记下所有的函数名，入参和返回值不现实。建议大家的学习方式如下"},{"parent":"8466847fbb5b519d","children":[{"parent":"65ce5525f01412f0","children":[],"id":"f67c147af9044a3d","title":"这两点主要是让大家在碰到一个功能的时候，能想到一个函数。&nbsp;<br>后续入参、返回值。可以用到的时候现查。基本就是按照简明知意"}],"id":"65ce5525f01412f0","title":"1.首先函数名要记住，函数的大致功能要记住"},{"parent":"8466847fbb5b519d","children":[],"id":"29aa8c0ffd22b098","title":"2.man手册的三卷要记住。 1卷就是shell命令，2卷就是系统调用，3卷就是库函数"},{"parent":"8466847fbb5b519d","children":[{"parent":"8af50c63f0d3dacf","children":[],"id":"b2e98d14f923fdcb","title":"先看名字，这块一般是函数的主体功能"},{"parent":"8af50c63f0d3dacf","children":[],"id":"fd6fc8c13dead5a6","title":"然后看描述，这块会说函数的头文件，紧接着看函数的声明。&nbsp;<br>看函数声明的时候，基本看参数的名字就可以知道要传啥"},{"parent":"8af50c63f0d3dacf","children":[{"parent":"85ad5c6faacdb609","children":[{"parent":"97797525c5f2c6e2","children":[{"parent":"16150321f6d68ae6","children":[],"id":"08bb17d163a4aadd","title":"返回值一般兼具两个任务。&nbsp;一个是正常的返回值。&nbsp;<br>另外一个通过返回值告诉你函数调用出错了"}],"id":"16150321f6d68ae6","title":"C语言没有错误处理。&nbsp;它的错误提示基本都通过返回值告诉你。&nbsp;<br>"},{"parent":"97797525c5f2c6e2","children":[{"parent":"94d4a6eb882c622c","children":[{"parent":"c539ca009f393883","children":[],"id":"efc6dbc4f47513a0","title":"一般情况下，返回-1，表示出错了。 <br>这时候只知道它出错，但是不知道错误的具体信息。 <br>所以这时候，一般系统会将错误信息，塞到errno里面。<br>perror就可以直接打印出来信息<br>"}],"id":"c539ca009f393883","title":"基本数据类型"},{"parent":"94d4a6eb882c622c","children":[{"parent":"8a01314c019a8634","children":[],"id":"9ef7a70b70a113d0","title":"返回结构体指针，或者其他指针。&nbsp;<br>这时候错误了，会返回NULL"}],"id":"8a01314c019a8634","title":"指针类型"},{"parent":"94d4a6eb882c622c","children":[],"id":"6247c4cbea5ac113","title":"所以一般情况下，先检查返回值是不是-1/ NULL<br>如果返回值是-1，perror打印错误信息"}],"id":"94d4a6eb882c622c","title":"返回值有两种可能"}],"id":"97797525c5f2c6e2","title":"返回值的问题"},{"parent":"85ad5c6faacdb609","children":[{"parent":"9a11b420f812ffd8","children":[],"id":"83695c349b509b26","title":"对指针的参数。<br>test1(const char *str)<br>test1(char *str)<br>"},{"parent":"9a11b420f812ffd8","children":[],"id":"f93171dcfca308a8","title":"一般指针参数，如果加了const。&nbsp;就意味着这个参数不会被修改。<br>这个参数是一个只读参数"},{"parent":"9a11b420f812ffd8","children":[],"id":"27cdd228d746d84a","title":"如果没加const。大概率会被改掉。&nbsp;<br>这时候比如需要的是某个结构体的指针。这时候指针一定要指向有效的内存，不然会报错"},{"parent":"9a11b420f812ffd8","children":[{"parent":"c1f16a58ac67e1ab","children":[],"id":"d609ded5f8592089","title":"如果有const修饰，这个参数就是给别人读取一下的（不会修改你）"},{"parent":"c1f16a58ac67e1ab","children":[],"id":"678dded83f4ae22e","title":"如果没有const修饰，这个参数承担了信息传递的任务。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"c1f16a58ac67e1ab","children":[],"id":"4aafeca8213e890a","title":"这个指针，一定是指向有效内存的。&nbsp;"}],"id":"c1f16a58ac67e1ab","title":"如果一个指针参数，有无const修饰。<br>其实说明了这个参数的作用"},{"parent":"9a11b420f812ffd8","children":[],"id":"78ea46e863a7409e","title":"看参数的名字，可以知道参数的大致作用。"}],"id":"9a11b420f812ffd8","title":"参数问题"}],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"85ad5c6faacdb609","title":"返回值和参数的规律问题"},{"parent":"8af50c63f0d3dacf","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"19px"},"id":"64a844d80f2aa0ba","title":"重点：&nbsp;记住函数名、函数的功能。<br>剩下的（参数、返回值、头文件）碰到了再通过man手册查<br>"}],"id":"8af50c63f0d3dacf","title":"3.如果忘了，直接查man手册"}],"style":{"font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"8466847fbb5b519d","title":"学习的方法"},{"parent":"50c6233b92d429a4","children":[{"parent":"a63e804c74ed4f84","children":[{"parent":"b31e6ef2a1767995","children":[],"id":"d8f2050108bf049f","title":"改变权限"},{"parent":"b31e6ef2a1767995","children":[],"id":"259adf66730d4889","title":"int chmod(const char *pathname, mode_t mode);"}],"id":"b31e6ef2a1767995","title":"chmod"},{"parent":"a63e804c74ed4f84","children":[{"parent":"e7604458fff3713e","children":[],"id":"c710e9f94cd94afd","title":"在Linux阶段，基本很多东西都是类型别名，所以需要知道如何查看类型别名的具体类型"},{"parent":"e7604458fff3713e","children":[{"parent":"d918f7cdcc3eac28","children":[],"id":"2932ef0738ec8c43","title":"gcc -E test1.c -o test1.i"},{"parent":"d918f7cdcc3eac28","children":[],"id":"f818580189a5ec53","title":"vim&nbsp;打开。&nbsp;<br>然后使用 /&nbsp;来搜索。<br>n是跳到下一个匹配项。 N是上一个"}],"style":{"font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"d918f7cdcc3eac28","title":"建议使用预处理指令。预处理之后，可以搜索。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"e7604458fff3713e","children":[{"parent":"3238905e0bcea00c","children":[],"id":"a0caa3f6b5d93575","title":"grep -nE \"mode_t\" test2.i<br>"},{"parent":"3238905e0bcea00c","children":[],"id":"2d12bb296b01e36b","title":"-C&nbsp;搜索的时候，顺便显示一下上下的行。&nbsp;<br>-C10&nbsp;顺便显示一下上下"},{"parent":"3238905e0bcea00c","children":[],"id":"5098a0e27fde927b","title":"因为结构体，有时候是想看结构体的具体内容。&nbsp;所以可以让它显示一下上下的内容，<br>方便看结构体里面的具体属性"},{"parent":"3238905e0bcea00c","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"2f666bc4f3707086","title":"如果想搜索一个结构体长什么样。&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;grep -nE \"FILE\" test3_chmod.i<br>从这里，可以知道行号。&nbsp;通过vim打开，跳到指定行。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"3238905e0bcea00c","children":[],"id":"e44dd34f4854346a","title":"-C10&nbsp;上下多展示几行"}],"id":"3238905e0bcea00c","title":"grep命令可以搜索。&nbsp;搜索的时候建议默认加上 -nE&nbsp;"},{"parent":"e7604458fff3713e","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"e22e5cd60e4feac9","title":"应该掌握如何查看一个类型别名的真实类型的<br>掌握如何查看一个结构体的字段。&nbsp;"}],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"e7604458fff3713e","title":"怎么去查看类型别名的具体定义"},{"parent":"a63e804c74ed4f84","children":[{"parent":"c6395c13f94c474a","children":[],"id":"7bad89d2deb2ec0d","title":"改变当前工作目录。&nbsp;"}],"id":"c6395c13f94c474a","title":"chdir"},{"parent":"a63e804c74ed4f84","children":[{"parent":"5e354c61a8e3f658","children":[],"id":"25b351b6c934f9e0","title":"获取当前工作目录"}],"id":"5e354c61a8e3f658","title":"getcwd"},{"parent":"a63e804c74ed4f84","children":[{"parent":"998832d3bd3542db","children":[],"id":"63bb2c1928d16d45","title":"创建目录"}],"id":"998832d3bd3542db","title":"mkdir"},{"parent":"a63e804c74ed4f84","children":[{"parent":"7c45a8bc008cdc2b","children":[],"id":"674093619a5c70fd","title":"删除目录"}],"id":"7c45a8bc008cdc2b","title":"rmdir"},{"parent":"a63e804c74ed4f84","children":[{"parent":"e8dc340fa4bf5b3a","children":[],"id":"8a8e91a85d431caf","title":"也可以直接看函数的形参名。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"e8dc340fa4bf5b3a","children":[],"id":"67db96c68cdf369b","title":"为什么我不显示提示vim下面的提示。&nbsp;写完函数名之后，下，选一下它。然后写括号就有了。<br>实在不行也可以截图，钉在这。&nbsp;&nbsp;"}],"style":{"font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"e8dc340fa4bf5b3a","title":"对于后续的学习来说，一定要学会用man命令。&nbsp;"}],"id":"a63e804c74ed4f84","title":"目录相关的系统调用"},{"parent":"50c6233b92d429a4","children":[{"parent":"930c4b7378bf90fe","children":[],"id":"ad0b83d74f455e32","title":"打开目录流 opendir"},{"parent":"930c4b7378bf90fe","children":[],"id":"ee0f61029abbe8b8","title":"关闭目录流 closedir"},{"parent":"930c4b7378bf90fe","children":[{"parent":"20129ebf9d90ceb7","children":[],"id":"6ac3cdf3d30ef5d2","title":"struct dirent *readdir(DIR *dirp);"},{"parent":"20129ebf9d90ceb7","children":[],"id":"48c6fba242bed1ef","title":"传入的DIR指针，就是从打开目录流着捞到的。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"20129ebf9d90ceb7","children":[],"id":"e0f9651cb7b96aaa","title":"返回的是一个 struct dirent *的指针。我们不需要做内存的释放动作，也就是不要free。&nbsp;系统自己会搞定这个事情"},{"parent":"20129ebf9d90ceb7","children":[{"parent":"30a9bc55a9a99bf5","children":[{"parent":"c7f80e8c159637d9","children":[],"id":"316b958b9d27ba01","title":"typedef unsigned long int __ino_t;<br>这个是从.i文件里捞到的"}],"id":"c7f80e8c159637d9","title":"&nbsp;ino_t d_ino"},{"parent":"30a9bc55a9a99bf5","children":[{"parent":"268c43a554337b17","children":[],"id":"2333d08e0c95ab4f","title":"这些数字不用记，使用宏定义去做判断"}],"id":"268c43a554337b17","title":"d_type :&nbsp;就是文件的类型，是靠一个数字来标识一种类型。<br>比如 1表示文件，2表示目录，4表示其他的。。。"},{"parent":"30a9bc55a9a99bf5","children":[],"id":"3748184736b85667","title":"d_name:&nbsp;就是文件的名字。"}],"id":"30a9bc55a9a99bf5","title":"结构体里面的东西，有哪些需要关注"}],"id":"20129ebf9d90ceb7","title":"读取目录流 readdir"},{"parent":"930c4b7378bf90fe","children":[{"parent":"1d59712b5248be64","children":[],"id":"a813f744f6980bda","title":"现在有什么信息？"},{"parent":"1d59712b5248be64","children":[],"id":"73881037d4e6a00a","title":"inode编号<br>type&nbsp;类型<br>name&nbsp;名字"}],"id":"1d59712b5248be64","title":"假设，想自己实现ls。&nbsp; ls -al"}],"id":"930c4b7378bf90fe","title":"目录流相关函数"},{"parent":"50c6233b92d429a4","children":[{"parent":"20ec5e0f20374952","children":[],"id":"d16738d04b29a5ec","title":"获取详细信息的函数"},{"parent":"20ec5e0f20374952","children":[{"parent":"e2a876ee4608e80a","children":[],"id":"a7dceb894e1f1cd5","title":"第一个参数是路径。&nbsp;可以是相对路径，可以是绝对路径"},{"parent":"e2a876ee4608e80a","children":[],"id":"774faf455d3a85cb","title":"第二个参数是结构体指针，没有const修饰。&nbsp;其实就是用来存储stat获取的<br>详细信息的"}],"id":"e2a876ee4608e80a","title":"int stat(const char *path, struct stat *buf);"},{"parent":"20ec5e0f20374952","children":[{"parent":"04605ed74eed03ec","children":[],"id":"f9c24e46b25e1744","title":"st_mode:&nbsp;类型&amp;权限"},{"parent":"04605ed74eed03ec","children":[],"id":"eeea4bfb6fa00b37","title":"st_nlink：&nbsp;硬链接数"},{"parent":"04605ed74eed03ec","children":[],"id":"b4a5940000dae00d","title":"st_uid：&nbsp;文件的所有者用户id"},{"parent":"04605ed74eed03ec","children":[],"id":"e1420f1eb1016fa4","title":"st_gid:&nbsp;文件所有者组id"},{"parent":"04605ed74eed03ec","children":[],"id":"902b8731139d0432","title":"st_size：&nbsp;文件的大小"},{"parent":"04605ed74eed03ec","children":[],"id":"963add8ffaf9d2ad","title":"st_mtim：&nbsp;最后修改时间。&nbsp;结构体。里面有秒值&amp;纳秒值&nbsp;"},{"parent":"04605ed74eed03ec","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"c05caa947b6add87","title":"stat获取的信息中，少了 name !"}],"id":"04605ed74eed03ec","title":"stat结构体中能够提供的信息"},{"parent":"20ec5e0f20374952","children":[{"parent":"a19b6183228b453d","children":[],"id":"4cfc2c1133f60d62","title":"大家晚上的时候。到当前步骤一定要能写出来。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"a19b6183228b453d","children":[],"style":{"font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"14ae4beb8b74ff06","title":"如果后续的转换过程代码能写出来更好，写不出来先不要着急"},{"parent":"a19b6183228b453d","children":[],"id":"ee993f5e899d4c04","title":"类型的转换。&nbsp; st_mode&nbsp; -&gt; - d c&nbsp;<br>权限的转换 664&nbsp; &nbsp;--&gt; rw-rw-r--"},{"parent":"a19b6183228b453d","children":[],"id":"fa38840cf722b461","title":"uid, gid&nbsp;转换为了对应的名字"},{"parent":"a19b6183228b453d","children":[],"id":"27c9598d9c4cbfec","title":"时间戳，转换为了&nbsp;年月日，时分这些信息"},{"parent":"a19b6183228b453d","children":[],"id":"2818165f6a6378ef","title":"底下三个转换能写出来更好"},{"parent":"a19b6183228b453d","children":[{"parent":"c251f856eaa964f8","children":[],"id":"9fdfcc63d98102b4","title":"readdir&nbsp;可以拿到一个一个的名字。<br>申请内存，然后将字符串存起来。&nbsp;<br>指针数组。&nbsp;存起来所有的。&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;可以将所有的名字都存储到指针数组里面。&nbsp;&nbsp;"},{"parent":"c251f856eaa964f8","children":[],"id":"533a9fb10b6aaa05","title":"qsort。&nbsp;数组塞进去、大小（sizeof(char *)）、函数指针"}],"id":"c251f856eaa964f8","title":"提升：&nbsp;继续写排序的"},{"parent":"a19b6183228b453d","children":[],"id":"35411e2a857763dc","title":"实现一下tree"}],"id":"a19b6183228b453d","title":"现在，我们能够打印出来一些比较初级的信息。&nbsp;<br>printf(\"%o %lu %d %d %ld %ld\", buf_p-&gt;st_mode, buf_p-&gt;st_nlink, buf_p-&gt;st_uid, buf_p-&gt;st_gid,<br>buf_p-&gt;st_size, buf_p-&gt;st_mtim.tv_sec);<br>"},{"parent":"20ec5e0f20374952","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"19px"},"id":"b0a15af9be7073d2","title":"信息一定要知道从哪里来，后续在业务中。<br>要用到这些信息的时候，从什么函数中获取它。"}],"id":"20ec5e0f20374952","title":"stat"}],"id":"50c6233b92d429a4","title":"系统编程"}],"root":true,"theme":"theme_wps_def","showWatermark":false,"id":"root","title":"目录流","version":497,"structure":"mind_free"}},"meta":{"exportTime":"2025-05-14 21:34:13","member":"","diagramInfo":{"creator":"","created":"","modified":"","title":"","category":""},"id":"","type":"ProcessOn Schema File","version":"1.0"}}